source_verse.display_text:
For every robe gathered by deceit,
and every garment, they will repay with restitution;
and they will wish that they had been burned with fire.

And I will give the wicked in exchange for his burial,
and the rich in exchange for his death;
for he committed no iniquity,
nor was deceit found in his mouth.

target_verses.display_text:
He sprang upon me with points of eyes;
He struck my jaw with a sharp point,
and together they rushed down upon me.
